| control | observed |
| --- | ---: |
| initial target indices | 0 0 |
| returned angle | 0 |
| returned shift x | -1 |
| plateau updates | 3 |
| returned final RMSE | 1 |
| explicit quarter-turn RMSE | 6.12323399574e-17 |
\image(figures/icp_local.svg)
